{"id":"n62764-3-8","stage":5,"title":"새파랗다 · 年纪轻轻","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62764-3-8-1","ko":"어제 만난 새파랗게 어린 후배가 나한테 반말을 하더라.","zh":"昨天遇到的那个非常年轻的后辈，居然用随便的语气跟我说话。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"만난","meaning":"遇见，偶遇，碰到","explanation":"만나다：遇见，偶遇，碰到；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"4","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만난","audio":"/audio/59a56b665b0716f1d6e1.mp3"}},{"text":"새파랗게","meaning":"年纪轻轻","explanation":"새파랗다：年纪轻轻；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"새파랗다","audio":"/audio/49aa26bcb5c6df1571a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62764","senseId":"3","lemma":"새파랗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새파랗게","audio":"/audio/e12642f0f540fa1ff1b7.mp3"}},{"text":"어린","meaning":"年轻","explanation":"어리다：年轻；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어린","audio":"/audio/f78bf8d27dff1667b0ba.mp3"}},{"text":"후배가","meaning":"后辈，晚辈，新人","explanation":"후배：后辈，晚辈，新人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"후배","audio":"/audio/d1877a494d990fd1bd03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73247","senseId":"1","lemma":"후배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후배가","audio":"/audio/efd85f9955c74bb2461e.mp3"}},{"text":"나한테","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나한테","audio":"/audio/a650b718a38da6e97157.mp3"}},{"text":"반말을","meaning":"平语， 非敬阶用语","explanation":"반말：平语， 非敬阶用语；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"반말","audio":"/audio/8576c3c2817c4685963b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15843","senseId":"1","lemma":"반말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반말을","audio":"/audio/13a61f94ee339054fb33.mp3"}},{"text":"하더라.","meaning":"表示说这样那样的话。","explanation":"하다：表示说这样那样的话。；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하더라","audio":"/audio/db4aecb98efe8e073128.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"遇见，偶遇，碰到","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"在去往某地的途中，偶然碰到某人。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"49aa26bcb5c6df15","term":"새파랗다","zh":"年纪轻轻","audio":"/audio/49aa26bcb5c6df1571a0.mp3","entryId":"62764","definition":"十分年轻。","pronunciation":["새파라타"]},{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年轻","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"d1877a494d990fd1","term":"후배","zh":"后辈，晚辈，新人","audio":"/audio/d1877a494d990fd1bd03.mp3","entryId":"73247","definition":"同一领域内比自己晚开始工作的人。","pronunciation":["후ː배"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"8576c3c2817c4685","term":"반말","zh":"平语， 非敬阶用语","audio":"/audio/8576c3c2817c4685963b.mp3","entryId":"15843","definition":"双方非常亲密或尊称关系不明确时使用的非正式语气。","pronunciation":["반ː말"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示说这样那样的话。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示说这样那样的话。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e467bc638c164e215d59.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62764-3-8-2","ko":"아마 후배가 네 나이를 몰라서 그랬을 거야.","zh":"大概是那后辈不知道你的年龄吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아마","meaning":"也许","explanation":"아마：也许","readings":[{"term":"아마","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71248","senseId":"1","lemma":"아마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아마","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3"}},{"text":"후배가","meaning":"后辈，晚辈，新人","explanation":"후배：后辈，晚辈，新人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"후배","audio":"/audio/d1877a494d990fd1bd03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73247","senseId":"1","lemma":"후배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후배가","audio":"/audio/efd85f9955c74bb2461e.mp3"}},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"나이를","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나이를","audio":"/audio/792fb404da598d0d3d32.mp3"}},{"text":"몰라서","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰라서","audio":"/audio/5168d00873b5c46d6539.mp3"}},{"text":"그랬을","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그랬을","audio":"/audio/cf6cea7c8bf30fc68465.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2a38de25ef5f5194","term":"아마","zh":"也许","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3","entryId":"71248","definition":"虽然不能说得很明确，猜测或估计很有可能地。","pronunciation":["아마"]},{"id":"d1877a494d990fd1","term":"후배","zh":"后辈，晚辈，新人","audio":"/audio/d1877a494d990fd1bd03.mp3","entryId":"73247","definition":"同一领域内比自己晚开始工作的人。","pronunciation":["후ː배"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"9584bdb8265fdb6c","term":"나이","zh":"年龄，年纪，岁数","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3","entryId":"60486","definition":"人或动植物等来到世上生存至今的年数。","pronunciation":["나이"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/4a85a70fca17da5471b9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.536,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/Se